# m1_play: the docs/RUNNING.md section 5 example (1800 ticks; against the M1 build: score 570,
# lives 2; at M7: score 1714, F2). It also pins the case a rewind crosses a collection.
# Re-pinned for the catch-up table clock (waves.zig: a thin field runs the stage table
# faster): the waves come sooner and the sweep no longer lives through 1800 ticks of stage 1
# (no sweep shape tried did, as m2_play found for the whole stage at M7). Its moves start 4
# ticks later than before (UP from 64, not 60), so that a rewind still crosses a grab:
# - 232 (game tick 202): the first gnat string (a formation) is gone: crate 1, an F (drops
#   0 -> 1, pickups 1), +200 on top of the gnat's 10 (score 40 -> 250). The cores crate at
#   424, F2 at 436, crate 3 at 464.
# - 623 (tick 593): the sweep flies into an F crate: F2 -> F3 (weapon 2 -> 3), score 1022,
#   pickups 0.
# - 669 (tick 639): a hit: REWIND, target 519, lives 3 -> 2. The 20 bug-report frames hold
#   tick 639; the playback then steps back 2 ticks per frame and at 712 (tick 591, before the
#   grab) the weapon is F2 again and the crate is back on screen (pickups 1, score 922).
# - Resume at 749 with tick 519: the world of tick 519 had F2, and the auto rewind's power
#   loss (M7) takes a level at the resume: F1, mercy 80.
# - The replayed run is hit again at 821 (lives 1, resume at 901) and at 1083 (lives 0,
#   resume at 1163), F2 again at 1223; the next hit at 1269 is GAME OVER (state 3, score
#   1071, F2) and the title follows at 1329 (state 0) for the rest of the run.
--frames 1800 --dump-exports debug_state,debug_score,debug_lives,debug_enemies,debug_weapon --at "231 debug_drops == 0" --at "232 debug_drops == 1" --at "232 debug_pickups == 1" --at "232 debug_score == 250" --at "424 debug_cores == 1" --at "435 debug_weapon == 1" --at "436 debug_weapon == 2" --at "463 debug_drops == 2" --at "464 debug_drops == 3" --at "622 debug_weapon == 2" --at "623 debug_weapon == 3" --at "623 debug_pickups == 0" --at "623 debug_score == 1022" --at "668 debug_state == 1" --at "669 debug_state == 4" --at "669 debug_rewind_target == 519" --at "669 debug_lives == 2" --at "711 debug_weapon == 3" --at "712 debug_state == 4" --at "712 debug_weapon == 2" --at "712 debug_pickups == 1" --at "712 debug_score == 922" --at "748 debug_state == 4" --at "749 debug_state == 1" --at "749 debug_game_tick == 519" --at "749 debug_weapon == 1" --at "749 debug_mercy == 80" --at "821 debug_lives == 1" --at "1083 debug_lives == 0" --at "1268 debug_state == 1" --at "1269 debug_state == 3" --at "1329 debug_state == 0" --at "300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "780 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1200 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 0" --expect "debug_score == 1071" --expect "debug_lives == 0" --expect "debug_weapon == 2"
